  intent: 'esc-006 The Exit Shrinks Every Round. v4''s rotating gap (20deg/s, speed 6-13, 7 rounds), but the gap narrows from 30deg on round 1 to 18deg on round 7 (finalGapDegrees). Early rounds favour the ball, late rounds the wall, so the score tightens as the series goes on. Even at 18deg the starting ball fits (chord ~0.31R vs ball ~0.17R).'
